  "body": "I created a room on my local Synapse server, invited a bot, sent some messages to it and tried to leave the room. Since then, every time I try to change anything about the room (the name, I try to leave, etc) I get \"500 Internal Server Error\" from Synapse.\r\n\r\nThe log prints:\r\n```\r\n2017-08-09 02:46:35,103 - synapse.http.server - 139 - ERROR - POST-14727- Failed handle request synapse.http.server._async_render on <synapse.rest.ClientRestResource object at 0x7f9a815e2490>: <SynapseRequest at 0x7f9a78225680 method=POST uri=/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/!CIpwVxWlQULlSKjjbc:dries.info/leave?access_token=<redacted> clientproto=HTTP/1.0 site=8008>\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/http/server.py\", line 116, in wrapped_request_handler\r\n    yield request_handler(self, request, request_metrics)\r\nException: Trying to persist state with unpersisted prev_group: 35494\r\n2017-08-09 02:46:35,104 - twisted - 131 - CRITICAL - - Unhandled error in Deferred:\r\n2017-08-09 02:46:35,105 - twisted - 131 - CRITICAL - -\r\n```",
